# Node for the gates (lint, test, build) is pinned in .nvmrc and package.json
# engines; llm4ts checks the node on PATH against them before the first gate.
# When the machine running llm4ts cannot switch Node (nvm use / fnm use),
# uncomment the next line with the exact version and pnpm fetches and runs it
# itself, independent of PATH (a one-time download):
# use-node-version=22.20.0
